msgid ""
"When enabled, display captions in the gallery window. This is available for "
"slideshows, images, and image galleries."
msgstr ""
"Ko je omogočeno, prikaže napise v oknu galerije. To je na voljo za "
"diaprojekcije, slike in galerije slik."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3671
msgid "Advanced lightbox features are available through MetaSlider Gallery Pro."
msgstr "Napredne funkcije lightboxa so na voljo preko MetaSlider Gallery Pro."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3673
msgid "Get a preview of the advanced features available in MetaSlider Gallery Pro."
msgstr ""
"Pridobite predogled naprednih funkcij, ki so na voljo v MetaSlider Gallery "
"Pro."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3676
msgid ""
"These advanced LightGallery.js plugins are available in the Pro version "
"with additional customization options."
msgstr ""
"Ti napredni dodatki za LightGallery.js so na voljo v Pro različici z "
"dodatnimi možnostmi prilagoditve."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3704 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3705
msgid "specific Pages"
msgstr "specifične strani"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3707
msgid ""
"Select pages where gallery should be disabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"pages. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Izberite strani, kjer naj bo galerija onemogočena. Prikazuje do 100 "
