#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3707 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3708
msgid ""
"Select pages where gallery should be enabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"pages. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Izberite strani, kjer naj bo galerija omogočena. Prikazuje do 100 "
"najnovejših strani. Vtipkajte za iskanje."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3752 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3753
msgid "specific Posts"
msgstr "specifične objave"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3755
msgid ""
"Select posts where gallery should be disabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"posts. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Izberite objave, kjer naj bo galerija onemogočena. Prikaže do 100 "
"najnovejših objav. Vnesite za iskanje."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3755 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3756
msgid ""
"Select posts where gallery should be enabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"posts. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Izberite objave, kjer naj bo galerija omogočena. Prikaže do 100 najnovejših "
"objav. Vnesite za iskanje."

